            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "i love these ai + 3d workflows the intangible team is pushing on. generative video models are getting amazing but giving them a spatial 3d references makes it SO much faster to iterate. and now you can do it without needing to open up blender or another 3d tool. https://t.co/PzSa5MakYO"
      },
      {
        "attachments": {
          "media_keys": [
            "3_2120664907033026560"
          ]
        },
        "author_id": "2013613489798160388",
        "conversation_id": "2120665183525757189",
        "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:49:14.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2120665183525757189"
        ],
        "entities": {
          "urls": [
            {
              "display_url": "pic.x.com/GmylGXvrVA",
              "end": 304,
